menuconfig CRC_N32
	bool "N32 CRC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_NSING_N32_CRC_ENABLED
	select USE_NSING_CRC
	select CRC_DRIVER_HAS_CRC32_MPEG2
	help
	  Enables Nations Technologies N32 family CRC driver.

	  The N32G45 CRC unit only implements the CRC-32/MPEG-2 algorithm
	  (fixed polynomial 0x04C11DB7, non-reflected, no final XOR), so
	  only the CRC32_MPEG2 computation type is supported.
